   "start_s": 516.985,
   "end_s": 518.015,
   "dur_s": 1.03,
   "before_n": 94
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 94,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 518.015,
   "end_s": 522.275,
   "text": "Put your own loan on that scale, and you can see which of them you are closest to."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 522.275,
   "end_s": 523.135,
   "dur_s": 0.86,
   "before_n": 95
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 95,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 523.135,
   "end_s": 531.215,
   "text": "Those lines rest on our assumptions: a loan taken out at the October 2023 rate, a median bill, and a three-year stay."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 531.215,
   "end_s": 532.075,
   "dur_s": 0.86,
   "before_n": 96
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 96,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 532.075,
   "end_s": 534.135,
   "text": "The one-point line fits none of them."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 534.135,
   "end_s": 535.7,
   "dur_s": 1.565,
   "before_n": 97
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 97,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S19",
   "start_s": 535.7,
   "end_s": 540.19,
   "text": "These are national average rates, median bills, and three made-up borrowers."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 540.19,
   "end_s": 541.195,
   "dur_s": 1.005,
   "before_n": 98
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 98,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S19",
   "start_s": 541.195,
   "end_s": 550.395,
   "text": "In 2025, half of refinance bills fell between $3,443 and $8,270."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 550.395,
   "end_s": 550.875,
   "dur_s": 0.48,
   "before_n": 99
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 99,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S19",
   "start_s": 550.875,
   "end_s": 554.075,
   "text": "A real rate, a real bill and a real balance will be different."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 554.075,
   "end_s": 554.895,
   "dur_s": 0.82,
   "before_n": 100
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 100,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S19",
   "start_s": 554.895,
   "end_s": 560.675,
   "text": "Paying the fees by adding them to the loan, or choosing a shorter term, changes the math too."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 560.675,
   "end_s": 562.23,
   "dur_s": 1.555,
   "before_n": 101
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 101,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S20",
   "start_s": 562.23,
   "end_s": 566.69,
   "text": "Which leaves the one number only you know: how long you will stay."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 566.69,
   "end_s": 567.945,
   "dur_s": 1.255,
   "before_n": 102
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 102,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S20",
   "start_s": 567.945,
   "end_s": 578.495,
   "text": "For Nora, the same offer comes out $1,039 ahead if she sells after three years, and $8,093 ahead if she stays seven."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 578.495,
   "end_s": 579.605,
   "dur_s": 1.11,
   "before_n": 103
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 103,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S20",
   "start_s": 579.605,
   "end_s": 582.185,
   "text": "The rate cut decides how fast the fees come back."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 582.185,
   "end_s": 582.785,
   "dur_s": 0.6,
   "before_n": 104
